WEBVTT

00:07:28.333 --> 00:07:30.268
"Why not me?

00:07:30.292 --> 00:07:31.809
Terrible things happen to you,

00:07:31.833 --> 00:07:33.934
just like they do everybody else.

00:07:33.958 --> 00:07:35.393
That's your life now,

00:07:35.417 --> 00:07:37.809
time to sink or swim."

00:07:37.833 --> 00:07:39.518
The real tragedy

00:07:39.542 --> 00:07:43.226
is that not enough of us
seem to know this any longer.

00:07:43.250 --> 00:07:44.518
We seem to live in an age

00:07:44.542 --> 00:07:46.684
where we're entitled to a perfect life,

00:07:46.708 --> 00:07:50.393
where shiny, happy photos
on Instagram are the norm,

00:07:50.417 --> 00:07:52.101
when actually,

00:07:52.125 --> 00:07:56.434
as you all demonstrated
at the start of my talk,

00:07:56.458 --> 00:07:59.250
the very opposite is true.